Subject: [BioC]  limma layout query (genepix GAL file)
In-Reply-To: <mailman.3.1128160800.8676.bioconductor@stat.math.ethz.ch>
References: <mailman.3.1128160800.8676.bioconductor@stat.math.ethz.ch>
