From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Tue Oct  4 15:56:47 2005
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Tue, 04 Oct 2005 09:56:47 -0400
Subject: [BioC] Ways to verify identity samples
