Hi Ann,

The reason we don't provide barley1 annotation package is that, as you 
mentioned, the Affymetrix Barley1_annot.csv is _not_ enough to build an 
annotation package.  You may find that we only have few plant annotation 
packages available for the same reason.  Unless there are other resources 
provided, the packages for those species are still unavailable.  

If you find (or someone else provides) another useful mapping files, I can 
try to build the barley1 annotation package.

Best,
Ting-Yuan

