------------------------

PERSONNEL REQUISITION (Full time regular appointment)

Job Title:		Data Analyst
Department:	 	Algorithms & Data Analysis
Reports To:	 	Manager, Algorithms & Data Analysis
Contact:		Debi_Higgs at affymetrix.com

DESCRIPTION

We have an exciting opportunity in the Algorithms and Data Analysis group focused
on the development of analysis approaches in the nascent field of microarray-based
exploration of chromosomal rearrangement.  The near-term focus of the job is on
analysis development and support for chromosome copy number estimation and mapping
of LOH regions but longer term work will encompass analysis of other microarray
applications.


ESSENTIAL DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES

  * Development and assessment of analysis methods for solving real-world
    biological problems.
  * Implementation of analysis techniques in prototype software which can be used
    in research and product development and which can be later handed over to
