    internal and external scientific meetings.
  * Working closely with other Affymetrix departments including advanced research,
    product development, software development, marketing and legal.

JOB REQUIREMENTS

To qualify, you should have a masters or PhD in Statistics, Computer Science,
Mathematics or a Physical science, with a firm background in applied data analysis.
You should have advanced programming skills in
  * C++
  * One of R, S, Splus or Matlab
  * Perl
Other requirements are excellent communication skills, strong initiative and
demonstrated ability to take ownership of challenging problems.  Experience in
analysis of microarray data considered a strong plus, as is experience with other
genomic technologies.


