Have a look at the pairwise.comparison and pairwise.filter methods in
simpleaffy. Alternatively, you could try something like (assuming x
contains your matrix of PMA calls):

x[x=="P"] <- 1
x[x!=1]   <- 0

sums <- apply(x,1,sum)
keep <- (sums >= 2)

