From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Wed Oct 26 14:54:51 2005
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Wed, 26 Oct 2005 08:54:51 -0400
Subject: [BioC] Affymetrix question
