Hi Jacob,

although the documentation is not ready yet (for this reason you can 
contact me directly), oligo and makePlatformDesign can handle both 100K 
and 500K SNP chips (provided that you have the sequence and annotation 
files).

at this point, you need to build the environment using the function:

> makePDpackage(CDF_file,probe_fasta_file,annot_file,type="SNP")

after installing the package created from the step above, you can read 
your CEL files using:

> data = read.celfiles(list.celfiles())

kind regards,
benilton

